  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>28</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>70</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>α</mi></math> are the coefficient of four consecutive terms in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi></math> equals"
  },
